            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“I will make the Egyptians respect you so that when my people leave, they will not go empty-handed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Every Israelite woman will go to her Egyptian neighbours and to any Egyptian woman living in her house and will ask for clothing and for gold and silver jewellery. The Israelites will put these things on their sons and daughters and carry away the wealth of the Egyptians.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
